WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
Drive Impact is blocked and splats Ryu against the wall.

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.700
Crouching heavy punch catches the wall-splatted opponent.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.650
Light Gou Hadoken connects in the corner juggle.

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.450
Heavy Tatsu continues the wall-splat conversion.

5
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:05.950
Ryu recovers beside the wall after the ender.
